WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.810
Tel Aviv, 14 May 1948.

2
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.920
David Ben-Gurion reads out a
scroll declaring a new state.

3
00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:11.620
Its last words trust
in the Rock of Israel.

4
00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:16.140
Genesis promises a land from the
river of Egypt to the Euphrates.

5
00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.090
The modern State is smaller, and
its edges are still disputed.

6
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:24.360
So is the modern State of Israel
the Promised Land of the Bible?

7
00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.240
In this mission, you'll
trace the State's story:

8
00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:33.140
1948, the wars of 1967 and
1973, and the intifadas.

9
00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.970
Then you'll compare Israeli
and Palestinian claims,

10
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.640
and very different Jewish responses.

11
00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:44.590
Your mission: find out why Jews answer
so differently about the State and the

12
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:45.640
Promised Land.
